<Track #add-indexeddb-revisioned-vfs-authority version="1" apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "completed" goal = "为浏览器提供可重开、跨实例原子 CAS 的 IndexedDB RevisionedVfsAuthority。" description = "扩展既有 xnl-revisioned-persistence 契约，在 xnl-vfs owner 中实现 workspace-durable IndexedDB authority，并验证公共浏览器构建面。" question_mode = "decision-tree" question_severity = "auto" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-08-03T02:48:06+03:00" updated_at = "2026-08-03T03:17:29+03:00" } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "behavior-deltas" domain = "behavior" path = "vfs://./behavior_deltas/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "revisioned-contract" domain = "code" path = "vfs://@/packages/vfs/src/revisioned-persistence.ts" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "indexeddb-persistence" domain = "code" path = "vfs://@/packages/vfs/src/indexeddb-persistence.ts" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "behavior" domain = "codument" path = "vfs://@/codument/behaviors/xnl-revisioned-persistence.xml" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "vfs-source" domain = "code" path = "vfs://@/packages/vfs/src/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "vfs-tests" domain = "test" path = "vfs://@/packages/vfs/tests/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "vfs-package" domain = "build" path = "vfs://@/packages/vfs/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_add_indexeddb_revisioned_vfs_authority { name = "add-indexeddb-revisioned-vfs-authority" child_mode = "dag" } (
    <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AP>
    先以独立实例和 reopen 红测固定浏览器持久 CAS，再实现 authority，最后验证公共导出、兼容与浏览器安全。
    </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AP>
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "Contract And Red Baseline" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AQ>
        冻结 IndexedDB authority 的持久事实、线性化与失败语义。
        </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AQ>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "建立 IndexedDB revisioned authority 红测" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AR>
            使用可控 IndexedDB runtime 覆盖 seed/reopen、clone、same-base competing writers、stale/no-op、abort/retry 和普通 persistence 共存。
            </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AR>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AS>
              reopen 恢复 exact snapshot/revision，已有事实不被新 seed 覆盖
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AS>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AT>
              两个独立实例 same-base 写入恰好一 applied/一 conflict
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AT>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AV>
              failure/abort 不推进，retry 可从真实 base 成功，read/input 均 clone 隔离
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AV>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "IndexedDB Authority" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AW>
        在 xnl-vfs 中实现专用 durable authority 与公共 factory。
        </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AW>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T2.1" name = "实现原子 IndexedDB RevisionedVfsAuthority" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AX>
            seed-if-absent；在单个 readwrite transaction 内读取、CAS、equality、推进 sequence 并写回；transaction complete 后才返回 workspace receipt。
            </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AX>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AY>
              实现只依赖既有 revision contract/equality，不引入 VCS 或应用层 owner
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AY>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AZ>
              conflict/unchanged/failed/applied closed outcome 与 Memory authority 语义一致
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2AZ>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B0>
              数据库升级保留普通 IndexedDbVfsPersistence stores 与数据
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B0>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "Public Surface And Verification" status = "DONE" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B1>
        发布 API、更新文档并执行完整验证。
        </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B1>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T3.1" name = "验证公共导出、构建与兼容" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B2>
            更新 package exports/docs，运行 VFS 全量 test/lint/build、ESM/CJS/types import、旧 IndexedDB regression 和浏览器依赖扫描。
            </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B2>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B3>
              root 与 revisioned subpath 均导出 factory/types，ESM/CJS/types 可消费；browser-safe 保证只属于显式 subpath
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B3>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B4>
              VFS tests、lint、build 与既有 IndexedDB persistence regression 全绿
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B4>
              <Criterion { id = "T3.1-AC3" checked = true } ?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B5>
              构建后 revisioned subpath 可达图无 Node-only builtin，strict validation 与独立验收通过
              </?01M1W1C2DM4P5WJ4D21N7XH2B5>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <AttractorCheck { use = "coding" }>
          )>
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <GapLoop { max_rounds = 3 on_exhausted = "block" verify_round = true }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
  )>
  <Schedule [
    <Dag { for = "space_add_indexeddb_revisioned_vfs_authority" } [
      <Node #P2 [
        <After { ref = "P1" }>
      ]>
      <Node #P3 [
        <After { ref = "P2" }>
      ]>
    ]>
    <Parallel { max_concurrent = 1 spot_check = true }>
  ]>
)>
